REMARK 999                                                                      
REMARK 999 SEQUENCE                                                             
REMARK 999 THE PROTEIN WAS EXPRESSED AS ONE CHIMERIC ENTITY WITH THE COMPLETE   
REMARK 999 SEQUENCE OF                                                          
REMARK 999 MGTGKELVLALYDYQEKSPREVTMKKGDILTLLNSTNKDWWKVEVNDRQGFVPAAYVKKLDPAQSASR 
